@baseUrl = http://localhost:5199
@ticketId = 1
@antiforgeryToken = replace-with-token-from-counter-page

### Search tickets using a real booking code and passenger verification field
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/counter/tickets/search?bookingCode=TEO123&passengerName=Nguyen

### Load eligible same-route flights and suggested seats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/counter/tickets/{{ticketId}}/flight-options

### Exchange an eligible ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/counter/tickets/{{ticketId}}/exchange
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgeryToken}}

{
  "newFlightId": 2,
  "reason": "Khách đề nghị đổi sang chuyến phù hợp hơn",
  "paymentConfirmed": true
}

### Cancel an eligible ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/counter/tickets/{{ticketId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgeryToken}}

{
  "reason": "Khách yêu cầu hủy vé",
  "refundConfirmed": true
}
